Brodek
$cards
DECK 1 {SPADES, HEARTS, CLUBS, DIAMONDS}

$initial
DRAW 33 ROTATE 1 U 2
OKAEC 1 FACE_LAST
OKAEC 10 FACE_LAST
OKAEC 2 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
OKAEC 6 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

$moves
MOVE_STACK OKAEC OKAEC
OR
    DEST Size > 1
    AND
        DEST Empty
        SRCSTACK Rank ascending
$win
OR
    PILE ALL OKAEC Empty
    PILE ALL DRAW Empty
